# Play test of Four Seasons (CIPlay four_seasons, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The weather-house's deck x -6..6, z -1..11 (2 m) in the lagoon, its jetty south to z -7; winter on the north islet (the
# shrine at 1 80, the ice spire at -20 94 with its tower and ladders at -12.3 94, the deck at the top 12 m over the
# ground); spring on the east (the cottage round 80 7, the pen x 84..92, z 2..14); summer on the south (the diver's hut round
# -40 -80, the reef at -25 -50, 7 m down); autumn on the west (the barn round -86 0, the bells at z -16, the orchard round
# -82 22).
island Four Seasons
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Year's Wheel
wait 5
expect animals Goat 3
expect animals Chicken 3
expect animals Turtle 3
expect animals Dolphin 2
at 0 -6 h=3
walk 0 -6 to 0 -2 h=2.05
zone weatherhouse
expect step 1
read Maren's almanac
expect step 2
open Weather-keeper's locker
expect step 3
at 1 75 h=10
zone winter
expect step 4
read The frost shrine's verse
expect step 5
zone den
expect message white bear
kill Polar bear
expect step 6
at -14 94 h=22
zone icecrown
expect step 7
open Winter's token
expect story token 1
expect step 8
at 80 0 h=8
zone spring
expect step 9
read The shepherdess's note
expect step 10
catch Goat 3
expect step 11
open Spring's token
expect story token 2
expect step 12
at -40 -74 h=6
zone summer
expect step 13
read The diver's log
expect step 14
at -25 -50 h=-4
zone reef
expect step 15
open Summer's token
expect story token 3
expect step 16
at -86 -9 h=7
zone autumn
expect step 17
read The harvest rhyme
expect step 18
zone orchard
kill Warthog
expect step 19
use bellsow
expect message sour note
use bellplough
use bellsow
use bellreap
use bellstore
expect shown autumntoken
open Autumn's token
expect story token 4
expect step 20
at 0 9.8 h=3
zone wheelroom
wait 2
expect step 21
use wheel
expect shown wheelturning
expect story yearseed 1
expect step 22
read Maren's last page
expect step 23
open Weather-keeper's chest
expect done
open Diver's box
open Sunk crate
open Winter landing box
